  "title": "Moroccan-Style Stuffed Acorn Squash",
  "description": "This Moroccan-style stuffed acorn squash recipe, filled with vegetables, chickpeas, raisins, and couscous. Use vegetable broth for a vegetarian meal.",
  "authors": [
